# pop'n music 7: one BINGO de 7!! round (PLAN.md section 20).
# From a save at level 1 (BINGO de 7: YES), e.g. a fresh save (the ROM set's RTC) given
# tools/unlock.py popn7 --nvram DIR phase=3:
#   hiraku-popn7 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn7-bingo.his
# Stage 1, ANTHEM / GLORIA (the music select's first song, normal mode), is played from its
# chart: 154 notes, lanes 0-8 = buttons 1-9, at frame 6181 + t * 58.5 / 1000 (t in 1/1024 s;
# the song starts at frame 6182, 0x80216c94 counts its frames): 154 GREAT, full combo. That
# meets square 26's condition (SCORE 100000 DEFSPEED); stage 2 is left to fail. After the
# round the card opens 26: rtc.nv 0x87/0x8b/0x8f 0 -> 0x20 (bit 5), the checksum at 0x56 follows.
# Watches: the credit's hint (0x80352ae0, a bingo number - 1), the song's frame, stage results.
game popn7
watch target u32 0x80352ae0
watch songf u32 0x80216c94
watch r0 u32 0x80216d40
watch r1 u32 0x80216d44
watch r2 u32 0x80216d48
watch r3 u32 0x80216d4c
watch r4 u32 0x80216d50
watch r5 u32 0x80216d54
watch r6 u32 0x80216d58
watch r7 u32 0x80216d5c
at 4400 press "Coin 1" 6
at 4440 press "Coin 1" 6
at 4560 press "P1 Button 5" 4
at 4800 press "P1 Button 5" 4
at 5100 press "P1 Button 5" 4
